n                                q.add(v[i]);\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            return dis[t] != -1;\n        }\n\n        private long dfs(int pos, long flow, long[] dis, int[] cur, boolean[] vis) {\n            if (pos == t) return flow;\n            vis[pos] = true;\n            long tmp = flow;\n            int start = (cur[pos] != -1) ? cur[pos] : head[pos];\n            for (int i = start; i != -1; i = nxt[i]) {\n                if (!vis[v[i]] && w[i] != 0 && dis[v[i]] == dis[pos] + c[i]) {\n                    cur[pos] = i;\n                    long fl = dfs(v[i], Math.min(flow, w[i]), dis, cur, vis);\n                    cost += fl * c[i];\n                    w[i] -= fl;\n                    w[i ^ 1] += fl;\n                    flow -= fl;\n                    if (flow == 0) break;\n                }\n            }\n            return tmp - flow;\n        }\n\n        long dinic(int s, int t) {\n            cost = 0;\n            this.t = t;\n            int[] cur = new int[N];\n            while (spfa(s, t)) {\n                Arrays.fill(cur, -1);\n                boolean[] vis = new boolean[N];\n                dfs(s, INF, new long[N], cur, vis);\n            }\n            return cost;\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        StringTokenizer st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n        int n = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        int m = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        int kk = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        int c = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        int d = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        int[] a = new int[55];\n        st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n        for (int i = 1; i <= kk; i++) {\n            a[i] = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        }\n        FlowGraph g = new FlowGraph();\n        int s = 0;\n        int t = n * 100 + 1;\n        for (int i = 1; i <= 100; i++) {\n            g.addEdge(i, t, INF, 0);\n        }\n        for (int i = 1; i <= kk; i++) {\n            g.addEdge(s, (a[i] - 1) * 100 + 1, 1, 0);\n        }\n        for (int i = 2; i <= n; i++) {\n            for (int j = 1; j < 100; j++) {\n                g.addEdge((i - 1) * 100 + j, (i - 1) * 100 + j + 1, INF, c);\n            }\n        }\n        int t1, t2;\n        for (int _ = 1; _ <= m; _++) {\n            st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n            t1 = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n            t2 = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n            for (int i = 1; i < 100; i++) {\n                for (int j = 1; j <= kk; j++) {\n                    int val = c + d * (j * j - (j - 1) * (j - 1));\n                    g.addEdge((t1 - 1) * 100 + i, (t2 - 1) * 100 + i + 1, 1, val);\n                    g.addEdge((t2 - 1) * 100 + i, (t1 - 1) * 100 + i + 1, 1, val);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        System.out.println(g.dinic(s, t));\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-3.6954811548639555e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -0.000120751719805412, -0.00030250742565840483, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.06196783855557442, -0.06202016398310661, 0.0, 0.0, -6.794906312279636e-06, -0.00022742546570952982, -0.030322810634970665, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.005977017804980278, -0.005312729626893997, -0.00026639728457666934, -1.3158410787582397, -1.6689160474925302e-05, -0.03839343413710594, -6.3774932641536e-05, -0.0002109781780745834, -6.556489552167477e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, -6.437280717364047e-06, -7.426462980220094e-05, -0.0053442707285285, 0.0, -2.0265558760002023e-06, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.0009114163694903255, -1.1920922133867862e-06, -4.768370445162873e-07, -3.540453326422721e-05, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -4.6491513785440475e-06, -0.0032831120770424604, -4.5536911784